00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.400
Definitely like a thing.

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:11.800
I just don't know who's, and now I'm thinking about like, well, why would he smile if he's

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:19.040
in America? I was going to say, I feel like it's more, I would be less surprised if it was the American

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:22.760
version. Cause I just feel like that there's like that whole thing with Pokemon too, where it's like

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:29.580
the, in America, like Charizard was, was like marketed heavier because like they thought

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:31.280
Americans wouldn't like the cute Pokemon.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.040
