uh, enemies or reveal other floor tiles underneath them.

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:14.360
Uh, it's very unclear what's going to be under the floor tile.

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:18.000
So you might as well just flip things around as long as you're out of harm's way.

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:23.700
Uh, there are boundary, uh, walls along the, uh, perimeter of each room.

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:27.820
