00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.460
But that is how you take out enemies.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:37.380
You, uh, flip the tiles or create, um, you know, like flipping some tiles or stepping on

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:41.140
some tiles, create seismic waves throughout the room that ripple and hit the enemies as

