well. All these things cause the enemies to hit into the walls where they, uh, get knocked out.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:49.200
That is the only way to finish off an enemy.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.840
There isn't a projectile or melee attack.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:57.800
It's just simply hit them into a boundary and they will, um, uh, they will be

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:01.860
moved. Yeah, they'll be, yeah, they'll be, I was going to say removed, but sure they'll explode.

